  "body": [
    "Product Product Playbook 101 The next era of media storage Visual storage Dynamic space for all type of media. Smart search GPT-powered for results you can trust. Review & approval Comment & react in real-time Publish sites Create sites from stored files Mini-apps Supercharge your creative workflow Desktop sync Two-way file syncing Take a quick tour! See Playbook in action with our interactive product tour.",
    "API/SDK",
    "Solutions Use cases Enterprise Marketing Manage creative ops at scale with smart workflows. Media & Entertainment Manage production assets at scale with smart workflows. Creative Agency Collaborate with clients and streamline creative reviews. Consumer Brands Centralize brand assets and keep every team on brand. Game Studios Organize large game assets without paying twice for storage.",
    "Manage creative ops at scale with smart workflows.",
    "Manage production assets at scale with smart workflows.",
