    "Centralize brand assets and keep every team on brand.",
    "Organize large game assets without paying twice for storage.",
    "Resources Resources Help center & tutorials Quick start guides and tutorials Customer stories Real examples. Real results. Portfolio showcase Featured creatives and projects Free giveaway 500+ illustrations from our community More to explore About us Story of Playbook Blog Privacy & ownership Browse template gallery 100+ stunning templates and featured examples from our community.",
    "Pricing",
    "See everything. Find anything.",
    "As a team of creatives, we believe the things people create carry more than just data – they carry ideas, intentions, and effort. Our mission is to connect every creative around the world through their files. That's why we're building Playbook to make creative work easy to organize, easy to understand, and simply beautiful to share.",
    "We don't believe in dressing things up with big statements or empty values. We care about building things that work well, improve over time, and feel though thoughtful in the details.",
    "Progress comes from trying, learning, and improving. We move forward by building, sharing early, and staying open to change from feedback. Perfection isn't the goal, but momentum and understanding are.",
    "We believe great work helps people grow. That means supporting curosity, encouraging new directions, and giving people space to develop their craft overtime.",
    "We care about creating a great product, serving our customers well, and staying innovative. We're here to create something that lasts and a way of working we're proud of.",
    "Thinking three steps ahead, always.(she/her)",
    "Builds for what's coming next.(he/him)",
    "Finds signal in the noise.(she/her)",
    "Sleeps better when systems are stable.(he/him)",
    "Turns ambiguity into direction.(she/her)",
    "Trusts the numbers, but questions them anyway.(he/him)",
    "Builds things that look and feel effortless.(he/him)",
    "Obsessed with how things look and why.(he/him)",
    "– Jessica Ko, CEO & Co-Founder at Playbook",
